BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (of something or swapping in a cheaper substitute [T9lHBjJeZVI @ 00:00:14]. The TEM shops execute) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (exactly those levers on telecom: killing dead lines, downgrading plans, and renegotiating rates. Mark from) Tj ET
