BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 608.87 Tm (pattern in its forward-savings work: lines with no use for months still billing, plus closed satellite offices) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 593.65 Tm (whose services were never canceled, which it says happens more than you might think [F00NVfaC6Tk @) Tj ET
