BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.40 Tm ($100 a month each is roughly $5,000 buried inside a $400,000 total charge, very easy to miss even a year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.17 Tm (after the employee left [lxObl7Zpr2A @ 00:07:47]. Prior audits are no proof of a clean bill either. Auditel ran) Tj ET
